<title>JAPAN: Takada - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Takada - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 31.65		vs	   28.04</p>
<p> Operating   loss 592    million    vs	prft 356 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 751    million    vs	 prft 68 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 804    million    vs	  prft 9 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 55.73 yen	  vs     prft 0.65 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     14 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Takada Corp is a medium-sized general plant engineering firm.</p>
</text>
